Same-polarity conductance through a erfc tail
* Provenance: original Sansho R20b black-box experiment.
* sweep: length 0.10 0.25 0.50 1.0
* Test the resistivity integral using fixed mobility and a uniform background.
.param probe=0.10
Vdrive drive 0 0
Vref drive node_ref 0
Dref node_ref 0 mref
.model mref numd level=1
+ options resistor defa=1e-8
+ x.mesh loc=0 n=1
+ x.mesh loc=2.4 n=62
+ domain num=1 material=1
+ material num=1 silicon
+ doping uniform n.type conc=1e16
+ mobility material=1 electron majority mumax=1000
+ mobility material=1 electron minority mumax=1000
+ mobility material=1 hole majority mumax=500
+ mobility material=1 hole minority mumax=500
+ end
Vtail drive node_tail 0
Dtail node_tail 0 mtail
.model mtail numd level=1
+ options resistor defa=1e-8
+ x.mesh loc=0 n=1
+ x.mesh loc=2.4 n=62
+ domain num=1 material=1
+ material num=1 silicon
+ doping uniform n.type conc=1e16
+ doping erfc n.type conc=3e16 x.low=0 x.high=0.4 char.length={probe}
+ mobility material=1 electron majority mumax=1000
+ mobility material=1 electron minority mumax=1000
+ mobility material=1 hole majority mumax=500
+ mobility material=1 hole minority mumax=500
+ end
.options itl1=200 itl2=120 reltol=1e-5 abstol=1e-15
.dc Vdrive -0.01 0.01 0.005
.save i(vref) i(vtail)
.end
